{
  "slug": "drillspark-workflow-toolkit",
  "name": "Drillspark Workflow Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "DrillSpark Workflow Toolkit is a Claude Code plugin for workflow analysis, Mermaid diagram validation, code review, test generation, and security review. It helps engineering, product, and operations teams use repeatable workflows for planning, reviewing, and improving implementation quality inside Claude Code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `business-analysis` (Analyze business processes with SIPOC, ECRS, BPMN-style structure, KPI planning, and implementation roadmaps), `code-review` (Review code for correctness, maintainability, security, performance, and testability), `generate-tests` (Generate targeted tests for functions, hooks, components, APIs, and edge cases), `mermaid-validator` (Review Mermaid flowcharts for structural consistency, readable labels, safe conventions, and drill-down friendly IDs), `security-audit` (Audit applications for common security risks including auth flaws, injection, exposed secrets, unsafe configuration, and dependency issues)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install drillspark-workflow-toolkit@claude-community` from `jackasser/drillspark-workflow-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
